TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite in hydrothermal solution at 100C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

RATES
Calcite
-start
10  si_cc = SI("Calcite")
20  rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2) * (1 - 10^si_cc)
30  moles = rate * TIME
40  if (moles > M) then moles = M
50  if (moles < 0) then moles = 0
60  SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0    1.0
    -m     1.0
    -parms 10.0  0.001
    -steps 1000 in 100
    -bad_step_max 500

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic.out
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -pH     true
    -pe     true
    -si     Calcite Aragonite
    -kinetic_reactants  Calcite

END
